#: classes/FeatureIntro.php:66
msgid ""
"20+ AI Features are added! wpForo 3.0 introduces revolutionary AI features "
"that make your forum smarter, safer, and more engaging — while keeping you "
"in full control of every feature."
msgstr ""
"新增 20 多項 AI 功能！wpForo 3.0 引入了革命性的 AI 功能，讓您的論壇更聰明、更安全、更吸引人 - 同時讓您完全掌控每一項功能。"

#: admin/pages/tabs/ai-features-tab-overview.php:1318
msgid ""
"24/7 intelligent assistance for your forum members. Intelligent chatbot "
"powered by your forum's content. Provides instant answers based on indexed "
"discussions, suggests relevant topics, guides new members through common "
"tasks, and escalates complex questions to moderators when needed. Learns "
"from interactions, supports multiple languages, and maintains your "
"community's tone and style."
msgstr ""
"為您的論壇會員提供 24/7 "
"全天候的智慧型協助。智慧型聊天機器人由您的論壇內容驅動。根據索引的討論提供即時解答、建議相關主題、引導新會員完成常見任務，並在需要時將複雜問題升級至版主。從互動中學習、支援多國語言，並維持您社群的語調與風格。"

