#: classes/Settings.php:493
msgid ""
"Here you can change your forum style. There are six predefined styles "
"(default, red, green, orange, gray and dark), these are set of different "
"colors. You can change them and create your own set of colors. If you need "
"more customization, you can add custom CSS code in the corresponding "
"textarea. Also, you can change font size of forums, topics and post content."
msgstr ""
"您可以在此更改版面樣式。有六種預先定義的樣式（預設、紅色、綠色、橙色、灰色和深色），這些樣式有不同的顏色。您可以更改它們並創建您自己的顏色集。如果您需要更多的自訂功能，您可以在對應的文字區域中加入自訂"
" CSS 程式碼。此外，您也可以變更論壇、主題和文章內容的字型大小。"

#: classes/Settings.php:2461
msgid ""
"Here you can find many ways to protect your forum from spammers. Most of "
"them are already configured and enabled with default values. You can make "
"spam protection more powerfully if you configure Google reCAPTCHA in "
"Settings > Google reCAPTCHA section and install others spam protection "
"plugins like Akismet."
msgstr ""
"在這裡您可以找到許多方法來保護您的論壇不被垃圾郵件攻擊。其中大多數都已設定並啟用預設值。如果您在設定 > Google reCAPTCHA 區段設定 "
"Google reCAPTCHA，並安裝其他垃圾郵件防護外掛，例如 Akismet，就可以讓垃圾郵件防護功能更強大。"

#: classes/Settings.php:2901
msgid ""
"Here you can find social network sharing options. wpForo allows sharing "
"almost all forum content (forums, topics, posts individually). The share "
"button style and location is very flexible. There are a lot of options to "
"set button style, type, location, etc..."
msgstr ""
"wpForo 允許分享幾乎所有的版面內容 (版面、主題、個別文章)。分享按鈕的樣式和位置非常靈活。有許多選項可以設定按鈕的樣式、類型、位置等..."

#: classes/Settings.php:124
msgid ""
"Here you can manage admin bar displaying options, using WordPress date "
"format in forum and permalinks of general pages. If you have hmore then one "
"forum board, this settings are still are general for all forum boards."
msgstr ""
"在這裡您可以管理管理列的顯示選項、在討論區中使用 WordPress 日期格式以及一般頁面的永久連結。如果您有一個以上的討論版，此設定仍適用於所有討論版。"

#: classes/Settings.php:344
msgid ""
"Here you can manage forum specific components which are displayed on the "
"frontend. All options are grouped by forum layouts. You can find all "
"necessary options to manage forum layout specific features. Each forum "
"layout has its own specific features."
msgstr "在這裡您可以管理顯示在前端的版面特定元件。所有選項都依版面佈局分類。您可以找到管理版面特定功能的所有必要選項。每個版面都有其特定的功能。"

#: classes/Settings.php:1691
msgid ""
"Here, you can configure header information (FROM name and email) of forum "
"specific emails. You can set administrators and moderators email addresses "
"to get email notification when a new topic or reply is posted. Here you can "
"also find user registration, password resetting and post reporting email "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"在這裡，您可以設定討論區特定電子郵件的標頭資訊 (FROM 名稱和電子郵件)"
"。您可以設定管理員和版主的電子郵件地址，當有新主題或回覆張貼時，他們就會收到電子郵件通知。您也可以在這裡找到使用者註冊、密碼重設和回報文章的電子郵件範本。"

#: classes/Settings.php:855
msgid ""
"Here, you can find all settings related to topic and post creation including "
"rich editor settings, text limitations, attachments control, option to "
"enable WordPress plugin shortcodes in wpForo posts, post drafting and "
"preview options. Some settings are grouped by forum layouts and some of them "
"are general for all forum layouts."
msgstr ""
"在這裡，您可以找到所有與主題和文章建立相關的設定，包括豐富編輯器設定、文字限制、附件控制、在 wpForo 文章中啟用 WordPress "
"外掛程式簡碼的選項、文章起草和預覽選項。有些設定是依版面佈局分類，有些則是適用於所有版面佈局。"

