#: admin/pages/tabs/ai-features-tab-overview.php:1294
msgid ""
"Keep your forum active with AI-generated topics! The AI analyzes your "
"existing discussions and automatically creates engaging threads based on "
"your instructions every day or in any time period you want. Topics appear "
"naturally from AI created users or pre-defined users, sparking fresh "
"conversations. The AI can search for trending news and current issues "
"related to your community, then create timely, relevant topics that drive "
"engagement."
msgstr ""
"使用 AI 產生的主題讓您的討論區保持活躍！AI 會分析您現有的討論，並根據您的指示每天或在您想要的任何時間段內自動建立吸引人的主題。主題會從 AI "
"創建的使用者或預先定義的使用者中自然出現，引發新鮮的對話。AI 可以搜尋與您社群相關的趨勢新聞和當前議題，然後創建及時、相關的話題來推動參與。"

#: admin/pages/tabs/ai-features-tab-overview.php:1258
