msgid ""
"Tags are a free form method of categorization, currently being used to group "
"and categorize similar topics. The goal of using these tags in the forum is "
"to create a \"heat map\", an index of topics covered within the Forum. The "
"larger the size of the tag, the more discussions about the topic."
