#: classes/AIClient.php:205
msgid ""
"When AI features are enabled by the forum administrator, this site sends "
"forum content (topics, posts, and metadata) to the gVectors AI API (api."
"gvectors.com) for processing. This processing includes semantic search, AI "
"translation, summarization, content moderation, AI chat, and topic "
"suggestions."
msgstr ""
"當論壇管理員啟用 AI 功能時，本站會將論壇內容 (主題、文章和元資料) 傳送至 gVectors AI API (api.gvectors.com) "
"進行處理。此處理包括語意搜尋、AI 翻譯、摘要、內容管理、AI 聊天和主題建議。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3380
msgid ""
"When enabled, AI generates a summary and recommendations for search results. "
"This feature is automatically disabled when search returns fewer than 3 "
"results. Disabling saves credits."
msgstr "啟用時，AI 會產生搜尋結果的摘要和建議。當搜尋結果少於 3 個時，此功能會自動停用。停用可節省點數。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3657
msgid ""
"When enabled, AI will analyze new content for spam patterns including "
"promotional content, link spam, and automated bot submissions."
msgstr "啟用後，AI 會分析新內容的垃圾郵件模式，包括促銷內容、垃圾連結和自動化的殭屍提交。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3851
msgid ""
"When enabled, AI will check content against forum rules and policies, "
"detecting off-topic posts, prohibited content types, and policy violations."
msgstr "啟用時，AI 會根據論壇規則和政策檢查內容，偵測離題的文章、禁止的內容類型和違反政策的行為。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3807
msgid ""
"When enabled, AI will detect toxic content including hate speech, harassment,"
" threats, profanity, and other harmful content that violates community "
"guidelines."
msgstr "啟用後，AI 將偵測有毒內容，包括仇恨言論、騷擾、威脅、褻瀆和其他違反社群準則的有害內容。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3535
msgid ""
"When enabled, AI will suggest similar topics, related topics, and quick "
"answers when users create new topics. This helps prevent duplicate topics "
"and provides immediate assistance."
msgstr "啟用後，當使用者建立新主題時，AI 會建議類似主題、相關主題和快速解答。這有助於避免重複主題，並提供即時協助。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3685
msgid ""
"When enabled, AI will use indexed forum content as context to better "
"understand what is normal content vs spam for your specific forum."
msgstr "啟用時，AI 會使用索引的論壇內容作為上下文，以更好地瞭解特定論壇的正常內容與垃圾內容。"

#: admin/pages/forum.php:401
msgid ""
"When enabled, all topics in this forum will be created as private by default."
" Users cannot make topics public."
msgstr "啟用後，本論壇的所有主題預設都會建立為隱私。使用者無法公開主題。"

#: classes/Settings.php:4174
msgid ""
"When enabled, bot-generated replies will be set as unapproved and require "
"manual approval before being visible."
msgstr "啟用後，殭屍產生的回覆將設定為未核准，需要手動核准才會顯示。"

#: admin/pages/tabs/ai-features-tab-ai-tasks.php:1424
msgid ""
"When enabled, task runs automatically when a new post is approved (instead "
"of scheduled cron)"
msgstr "啟用時，工作會在新文章被核准時自動執行 (而非排程的 cron)。"

#: admin/pages/tabs/ai-features-tab-ai-tasks.php:1812
msgid ""
"When enabled, task runs automatically when a new topic is approved (instead "
"of scheduled cron)"
msgstr "啟用時，任務會在新主題通過時自動執行 (而非排程的 cron)。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3316
msgid ""
"When enabled, the AI Assistant toggle button has a highlighted background "
"color to attract attention. On hover it changes to the primary theme color."
msgstr "啟用時，AI Assistant 切換按鈕的背景顏色會突出顯示，以吸引注意。在懸停時會變為主要的主題顏色。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3283
msgid ""
"When enabled, the AI Assistant widget is displayed open by default on the "
"forum home page. The toggle bar is hidden on the home page when open. On "
"other pages the widget remains closed with the toggle."
msgstr ""
"啟用時，AI Assistant Widget 預設會開啟顯示在論壇首頁。開啟時，切換列會隱藏在首頁上。在其他頁面上，Widget "
"會與切換條一起保持關閉狀態。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3968
msgid ""
"When enabled, the chatbot will consider the content of the current page "
"(topic, forum) when answering questions."
msgstr "啟用後，聊天機器人回答問題時會考慮目前頁面（主題、論壇）的內容。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3957
msgid ""
"When enabled, the chatbot will search indexed forum content to provide "
"accurate answers based on your forum's knowledge base."
msgstr "啟用後，聊天機器人會搜尋已編入索引的論壇內容，根據您論壇的知識庫提供準確的答案。"

