#: classes/Settings.php:1212
msgid ""
"wpForo forum has a powerful user profile system which can be managed in this "
"setting page. Here you can hide/show forum header and footer on profile "
"pages, manage profile components like avatars, member titles, nickname, URL "
"structure, signature etc... In case you use BuddyPress or Ultimate Members "
"plugins, you can switch forum profile page to the plugin profile page."
msgstr ""
"wpForo "
"論壇擁有強大的會員個人資料系統，您可以在此設定頁面管理會員個人資料。您可以在設定頁面中隱藏/顯示版面頁頭和頁尾，管理個人資料元件，例如頭像、會員標題、暱稱、網址結構、簽名等等。如果您使用"
" BuddyPress 或 Ultimate Members 外掛程式，您可以將討論區的個人資料頁面切換到外掛程式的個人資料頁面。"

#: includes/installation.php:526
msgid "wpForo Forum Installation | "
msgstr "wpForo Forum安裝 |"

#: classes/Settings.php:1932
msgid ""
"wpForo has almost all kind of way to keep forum users updated about the "
"latest posted content. Users can subscribe to forums and topics, they can be "
"mentioned in posts, they can follow to other users. On all these cases, "
"users get email and in-forum notification. And all these features can be "
"managed in this admin section."
msgstr ""
"wpForo "
"擁有幾乎所有的方式讓論壇用戶了解最新張貼的內容。用戶可以訂閱討論區和主題，他們可以在文章中被提及，他們可以跟隨其他用戶。在所有這些情況下，用戶都會收到電子郵件和論壇通知。所有這些功能都可以在此管理區中進行管理。"

#: classes/Settings.php:1392
msgid ""
"wpForo has built-in member reputation system based on points user get when "
"he/she creates new topic, posts, when gets likes or dislikes. This system "
"grants Rating Titles and Rating Badges. All component of this system (number "
"of posts, titles, badges) can be customized and changed in this admin "
"section."
msgstr ""
"wpForo 內建了會員聲譽系統，當使用者建立新主題、發表文章、獲得喜歡或不喜歡時，都會獲得分數。這個系統賦予評級標題和評級徽章。此系統的所有元件 "
"(文章數量、頭銜、徽章) 都可以在此管理區段中自訂與變更。"

#: includes/phrases.php:1130
#, php-format
msgid ""
"wpForo has not found any protection solution against spam user registration "
"on the forum registration form. Please %1$s and enable the %2$s antibot "
"protection in %3$s or install other alternative %4$s to avoid registration "
"of spam users."
msgstr ""
"wpForo 未找到任何防止垃圾使用者註冊論壇註冊表單的解決方案。請 %1$s 並在 %3$s 啟用 %2$s 反垃圾程式保護或安裝其他替代 %4$s "
"以避免垃圾使用者註冊。"

#: classes/Settings.php:209
msgid ""
"wpForo has own cache system, enable this to reduce sql requests and make "
"your forum run faster."
msgstr "wpForo 有自己的快取系統，啟用它可以減少 sql 請求，使您的論壇運行更快。"

#: classes/Settings.php:235
msgid ""
"wpForo is a forum plugin which is loaded in one WordPress page, so the whole "
"forum with its categories, forums, topics, members and profile pages are "
"loaded dynamically in one WordPress page. Almost all components you can see "
"in the page content area (forum area) can be displayed or hidden in wpForo "
"settings, especially here, in the Display Components admin page."
msgstr ""
"wpForo 是一個在 WordPress 頁面中載入的論壇外掛程式，因此整個論壇的分類、版面、主題、會員及個人資料頁面都是動態載入在一個 "
"WordPress 頁面中。幾乎所有您可以在頁面內容區域（論壇區域）看到的元件，都可以在 wpForo 設定中顯示或隱藏，尤其是這裡的顯示元件管理頁面。"

#: classes/Settings.php:1498
msgid ""
"wpForo is one of the very rare plugins which has its own user registration "
"and login pages. Both features are based on WordPress functions. Here you "
"can control user registration, account approval and deleting settings. Also, "
"you can manage redirections after user login, register and password resting "
"actions."
msgstr ""
"wpForo 是極少數擁有自己的使用者註冊與登入頁面的外掛程式之一。這兩個功能都是以 WordPress "
"功能為基礎。您可以在此控制使用者註冊、帳號核准與刪除設定。此外，您也可以管理使用者登入、註冊及恢復密碼動作後的重定向。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3022
msgid ""
"wpForo is well integrated with BuddyPress and with all plugins and themes "
"based on BuddyPress. The integration includes changing forum profile page "
"URL to BuddyPress profile page URL, Activity Integration and Forum Tabs on "
"BuddyPress profile page."
msgstr ""
"wpForo 與 BuddyPress 以及所有以 BuddyPress 為基礎的外掛和主題整合得很好。整合包括將論壇個人資料頁的 URL 更改成 "
"BuddyPress 個人資料頁的 URL、活動整合以及 BuddyPress 個人資料頁上的論壇標籤。"

#: classes/Settings.php:3067
msgid ""
"wpForo is well integrated with Ultimate Members plugin. The integration "
"includes changing forum profile page URL to Ultimate Members profile page "
"URL, forum tabs in Ultimate Members profile page. Also, wpForo is integrated "
"with Ultimate Members' Real-time Notifications addon."
msgstr ""
"wpForo 與 Ultimate Members 插件整合得很好。整合包括將論壇個人資料頁的 URL 改為 Ultimate Members "
"個人資料頁的 URL，以及在 Ultimate Members 個人資料頁中加入論壇標籤。此外，wpForo 也與 Ultimate Members "
"的即時通知插件整合。"

#: classes/Settings.php:2286
msgid ""
"wpForo logging system allows tracking and providing live information about "
"forum viewers. It detects read/unread status of forums and posts for guests "
"and logged-in users individually. Here you can manage all functions and "
"features of the forum logging system."
msgstr ""
"wpForo "
"日誌系統允許追蹤並提供論壇瀏覽者的即時資訊。它可以偵測論壇的已讀/未讀狀態，以及訪客和登入用戶的個別文章。您可以在此管理論壇記錄系統的所有功能與特性。"

